abstract: >-
  Golden-section closure kernel of the AxiomicCoreness repo: the open
  phi-band word algebra (phi^-1 < |w| < phi, atom norm 1, contraction
  composition), the Delta-replay patch law with its exactness theorem,
  and the math_origin defect audit (11 entries, D9 open), as measured
  at commit 1e449302.
